From 64faad40463efa72603619eec6a6cd907e2af5fb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: desocketed <desocketed@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 15:38:17 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] menu: NX2NAVI_MENU_LIVE=1 (default 0) applies the shadow
 range row in the running game (the cascade distances on the patch page) and
 makes the menu's Save button the only write of nx2navi.ini (a note shows
 unsaved changes); cfg_live tells the rows which settings still take effect
 only after a restart

---
